From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: MUSA Integration <musa-integration@example.invalid>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 09:40:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] MUSA: route explicit DeepSelect through DSV4 indexer

Route an explicit ``deep_select`` kernel configuration through the MUSA
materialized and paged-logits indexer paths. The existing MUSA fast paths
otherwise bypass the generic SparseIndexerTopk dispatcher and continue to use
the in-tree radix selector. Nonzero-start windows retain their native or
reference top-k dispatch.

---
